Unofficial fan project
----------------------

ficsmap is an unofficial fan project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
sponsored by or approved by Coffee Stain Studios.

Satisfactory, its name, its map, its icons and all other game assets are
(c) Coffee Stain Studios. All rights to them remain with Coffee Stain Studios.

This repository contains no game assets. It does not contain the map tiles,
icons, collectible positions or any other data taken from the game. The map
dataset the app needs is generated locally by each user from their own,
legally obtained copy of the game. The published Docker images contain no game
data either.


